<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="image" data-kv-variant="square-grid" data-klic-component="image" class="kn-image"><div class="ku-grid-2" data-part="grid-2"><div role="img" aria-label="기초" data-part="art ratio-square"><span>KLIC</span><strong>기초</strong><span data-part="art-orbit"></span></div><div role="img" aria-label="구성" data-part="art ratio-square art-alt"><span>KLIC</span><strong>구성</strong><span data-part="art-orbit"></span></div></div><p data-part="muted">자체 제작 그래픽 · 외부 이미지 의존 없음</p></div>
